ANNEX — Criteria for imposing administrative fines (related to Article 7)
Enforcement Decree of the Special Act on the Construction of the Dalgubit Railroad [Annex]
General criteria
The Minister of Land, Infrastructure and Transport may reduce the amount of a fine under the individual criteria in subparagraph 2 by up to one half in any of the following cases. This does not apply to a violator in arrears on administrative fines.
(a) Where the violation is recognized as resulting from minor carelessness or error;
(b) Where the violator is recognized as having made efforts to correct or resolve the unlawful situation;
(c) Where a reduction is otherwise considered necessary, taking account of the degree of the violation, its motive and consequences.
2. Individual criteria
(a) Refusing or obstructing, without good cause, an act of a project implementer under Article 10 of the Act on Railroad Construction and Railroad Facilities Management, as applied mutatis mutandis under Article 5(2) of the Act.
Legal basis: Article 21(1)1 of the Act. Administrative fine: 3 million won.
(b) Failing to submit a report or materials under Article 15(1) of the Act, submitting a false report or false materials, or refusing, obstructing or evading an inspection.
Legal basis: Article 21(1)2 of the Act. Administrative fine: 3 million won.
